{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>האם</b> Two times in the Masorah: האם תמנו לגוע and the other in Job האם אין עזרתי בי וגו' — one who has no wife, as written אעשה לו עזר כנגדו, and likewise one who does not learn Torah, as written there ותושיה נדחה ממני, is considered as dead, as written האם תמנו לגוע."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:27.783262613Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}